            "review_text": "Wyndham\n7 contributions\n0\nBeautiful space to dine in\nJul 2022 • Couples\nI was here with my husband when we had a few days of vacation in Hanoi and this was a perfect restaurant we found. Ideal place for couples. We ordered a few different dishes and each one was delicious! The crab pasta here makes me impressed. It’s the first time we tried to eat a whole crab, even its skin. It’s fantastically delicious and I really liked it. Highly recommend!\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2022",
